  "job_B1.6.2.2_20251001_193254": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6nde \u00e6lcere synne, seo geworhte \u00e6ngles to atelicen deoflen, & \u00feone mann maca\u00f0 eac, Nu synden ehte heafodm\u00e6gna, \u00fea mugen oferswi\u00f0en \u00fea fores\u00e6de deoflen, \u00feurh Drihtenes fylste. An is Temperantia, \u00fe\u00e6t is gemetegung on \u00e6nglisc, \u00fe\u00e6t man beo gemetegod, & to mycel ne \u00feygge on Nytene eta\u00f0 swa \u00e6r swa heo hit habbe\u00f0, ac se gescadwise mann sceal chepen his m\u00e6les, & \u00feonne mid Seo o\u00f0er mihte is Castitas, \u00fe\u00e6t is cl\u00e6nnysse on \u00e6nglisc, \u00fe\u00e6t se l\u00e6wede hine healde buten forligere on Seo \u00feridde mihte is Largitas, \u00fe\u00e6t is cystignysse on \u00e6nglisc, \u00fe\u00e6t mann wislice aspende, na for God nyle \u00fe\u00e6t we beon gr\u00e6dige gitseres, ne eac for wurldgelpe forwurpen ure \u00e6hte, ac d\u00e6len heo mid Seo feor\u00f0e mihte is Pacientia, \u00fe\u00e6t is ge\u00f0yld gecwe\u00f0en, \u00fe\u00e6t se man beo ge\u00f0yldig & \u00feolemod for Gode, Se heofonlice wisedom cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t yrre h\u00e6f\u00f0 wununge on \u00fe\u00e6s dysigen bosme, \u00feonne he by\u00f0 to Seo fifte mihte is Spiritalis leticia, \u00fe\u00e6t is seo gastlice blisse, \u00fe\u00e6t man on Gode blissige betwux \u00deider we sculen efstan of \u00feysser earfo\u00f0nysse mid gastlicre blisse, \u00feonne by\u00f0 seo unrotnysse mid eallen Seo sixte mihte is Instantia boni operis, \u00fe\u00e6t is anr\u00e6dnysse godes weorcas. Gyf we by\u00f0 anr",
